00:05:15.831 --> 00:05:21.064
<v Host>The specialist moves the robot from far away to help with and teach during the surgery.

00:05:21.663 --> 00:05:24.232
<v Vocab>手伝ったり

00:05:24.632 --> 00:05:30.175
<v Host>Two verbs in this form list example actions: helping, teaching, and so on.

00:05:30.776 --> 00:05:39.872
<v Slow>8月から、大腸がんの患者5人が、この方法で手術を受けました。

00:05:40.672 --> 00:05:45.663
<v Host>Since August, five colorectal cancer patients have had surgery this way.

00:05:46.264 --> 00:05:48.855
<v Vocab>大腸がん

00:05:49.255 --> 00:05:51.608
