00:05:52.208 --> 00:05:59.432
<v Slow>5人とも、手術のあとの経過は良好だということです。

00:06:00.232 --> 00:06:03.375
<v Host>All five patients are reportedly recovering well.

00:06:03.975 --> 00:06:06.064
