00:06:06.463 --> 00:06:08.624
<v Host>It means the course of recovery.

00:06:09.223 --> 00:06:20.384
<v Slow>日本では、外科医が足りないことや、専門の医師が少ない地域があることが問題になっています。

00:06:21.184 --> 00:06:27.160
<v Host>In Japan, a lack of surgeons and areas with few specialists have become a problem.

00:06:27.759 --> 00:06:29.920
<v Vocab>外科医

00:06:30.319 --> 00:06:32.192
<v Host>It means a surgeon.

00:06:32.791 --> 00:06:34.975
