00:06:35.375 --> 00:06:37.704
<v Host>It means a region or area.

00:06:38.303 --> 00:06:49.656
<v Slow>遠隔手術ができれば、患者は遠くの大きな病院に行かなくても、地元で手術を受けられます。

00:06:50.456 --> 00:06:56.863
<v Host>With remote surgery, patients can have operations locally without going to a big faraway hospital.

00:06:57.463 --> 00:06:59.648
